.dc.html", "S19-CondenseNoPay.dc.html", "S20-CondenseError.dc.html", "S21-Search.dc.html", "S22-Edit.dc.html", "S23-CacheBreak.dc.html", "S24-Branch.dc.html", "S25-Budget80.dc.html", "S26-Budget100.dc.html", "S27-Usage.dc.html", "S28-UsageEmpty.dc.html", "S29-Providers.dc.html", "S30-ProvTesting.dc.html", "S31-ProvOk.dc.html", "S32-ProvFail.dc.html", "S33-ProvDetail.dc.html", "S34-Settings.dc.html", "S35-SettingsError.dc.html", "R01-Thread1024.dc.html", "R02-Inspector1024.dc.html", "M01-Thread.dc.html", "M02-SidebarSheet.dc.html", "M03-InspectorSheet.dc.html", "M04-Composer.dc.html", "M05-Usage.dc.html"], "notes": {"tProto": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "tally.chat \u00b7 clickable prototype", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1950, "page": "proto"}, "flows": {"x": 2070, "y": 0, "w": 420, "size": "m", "fill": "orange", "page": "proto", "text": "How to play (Main)\n\n1 First run: Set password (first click shows the mismatch error, second continues) > Add a provider > Test key > Save provider > click the composer to type > Send > thinking, streaming, then metadata.\n2 Click the long thread in the sidebar, click the composer and watch the cost strip roll, Send, click the reply's metadata for the breakdown, click the cost strip to open the Inspector.\n3 Just read: the cache pill drains warm > cooling > cold (speed: Tweaks > cachespeed, default 10x).\n4 Scroll up, hover the first message > Edit > Save and send > Edit anyway > new branch; click the < > switcher to swap.\n5 Send twice in the long thread: 80% banner, then 100% paused > Override for today.\n6 Mobile: menu > pick a thread; tap the cache pill or the inspector icon for the sheet.\n\nTheme and 1024 width: Tweaks panel."}, "holo": {"x": 2070, "y": 620, "w": 420, "size": "s", "fill": "blue", "page": "proto", "text": "Holo per view is listed in the Spec page. Holo sits only inside system components (Composer focus, ThreadItem active/streaming, CacheStatus warm, LayerRow selected, AssistantMessage streaming, primary Button) 